1
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,428
Y-Young…

2
00:00:06,655 --> 00:00:07,582
Young General?

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,283
You have the wrong person.

4
00:00:09,757 --> 00:00:11,151
This humble officer, Du Tie,

5
00:00:11,511 --> 00:00:13,408
salutes the Young General!

6
00:00:15,562 --> 00:00:16,297
Who was he calling just now?

7
00:00:16,513 --> 00:00:17,594
What general?

8
00:00:17,813 --> 00:00:19,209
That's my wife,

9
00:00:20,213 --> 00:00:21,156
looks like her, huh?

10
00:00:21,354 --> 00:00:22,425
She does!

11
00:00:22,839 --> 00:00:24,493
Spitting image!

12
00:00:26,216 --> 00:00:26,600
Old-timer,

13
00:00:26,794 --> 00:00:27,347
Care for a drink?

14
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:31,313
I served in the Qin army,

15
00:00:31,563 --> 00:00:33,725
carried its banner twenty years.

16
00:00:33,789 --> 00:00:34,609
This leg,

17
00:00:35,859 --> 00:00:38,065
I left on the northern frontier.

18
00:00:38,139 --> 00:00:39,044
So she…

19
00:00:39,097 --> 00:00:40,905
whose Young General is she?

20
00:00:40,971 --> 00:00:41,513
Her father

21
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:45,184
is the General Guardian of the North, Qin Lieshan.

22
00:00:45,264 --> 00:00:46,606
The court says he

23
00:00:46,791 --> 00:00:49,561
sold the border defense maps to Shuomo.

24
00:00:49,815 --> 00:00:50,999
The Qin house was seized,

25
00:00:51,189 --> 00:00:52,851
everyone scattered.

26
00:00:52,918 --> 00:00:53,412
I don't believe it!

27
00:00:53,592 --> 00:00:55,264
The General would never betray his country!

28
00:00:56,105 --> 00:00:58,298
Character profile updated:

29
00:00:58,361 --> 00:01:01,999
Qin Shuang, daughter of the General Guardian of the North.

30
00:01:02,093 --> 00:01:02,637
Old-timer,

31
00:01:02,706 --> 00:01:03,958
help me find out where the General is.

32
00:01:04,488 --> 00:01:05,715
This life of mine

33
00:01:05,773 --> 00:01:07,846
always belonged to the Qins.

34
00:01:07,912 --> 00:01:08,441
She…

35
00:01:08,519 --> 00:01:09,488
is she doing all right?

36
00:01:10,090 --> 00:01:12,323
She smiles now.

37
00:01:12,396 --> 00:01:13,006
If she smiles, that's good,

38
00:01:13,651 --> 00:01:14,443
that's good.

39
00:01:14,841 --> 00:01:16,542
Sister Qin hasn't said a word all day.

40
00:01:16,616 --> 00:01:17,282
Go cheer her up.

41
00:01:17,713 --> 00:01:18,282
Me?

42
00:01:24,113 --> 00:01:24,932
Where did you get this?

43
00:01:25,541 --> 00:01:26,734
In an old book chest,

44
00:01:26,804 --> 00:01:27,474
I found it.

45
00:01:28,097 --> 00:01:28,653
…It's nothing.

46
00:01:31,297 --> 00:01:32,424
That old man today

47
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:33,933
told me about your family.

48
00:01:33,995 --> 00:01:34,737
What else did he say?

49
00:01:35,195 --> 00:01:36,611
He said your father

50
00:01:36,688 --> 00:01:38,500
is no traitor.

51
00:01:40,521 --> 00:01:42,640
If I'm a convict's daughter,

52
00:01:42,715 --> 00:01:43,899
would you still want me?
